1
00:00:39,776 --> 00:00:45,600
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,048 --> 00:00:48,608
=Episode 7=

3
00:00:49,792 --> 00:00:50,848
(Pleasures of the Night)

4
00:00:56,079 --> 00:00:58,399
Take a look, Young Master.

5
00:00:58,679 --> 00:00:59,960
You have

6
00:01:00,159 --> 00:01:02,159
definitely come to the right place.

7
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,719
Our girls here

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,680
are truly top-notch.

9
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:09,760
Enjoy yourself!

10
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:15,920
Have a drink!

11
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:25,120
Your dancing is truly amazing!

12
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:26,799
Come on.

13
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:35,959
Who are you? Get lost!

14
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:37,000
Go on.

15
00:01:37,519 --> 00:01:38,280
Come closer to me.

16
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:42,840
Dance well, and I'll give you 20 taels!

17
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:47,599
You smell so good.

18
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,560
So good.

19
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,920
Young Master,

20
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:58,159
how would you like to enjoy yourself?

21
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,799
Just tell me.

22
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:03,200
Do you really enjoy doing this?

23
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:07,359
You're so sweet, Young Master.

24
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:10,719
Serving a handsome gentleman like you

25
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:12,319
is a pleasure for me.

26
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,000
Young Master?

27
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,800
Wait, Young Master.

28
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:20,159
If you don't let me touch you,

29
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:21,400
how can I teach you?

30
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:23,360
Where are you going, Young Master?

31
00:02:40,576 --> 00:02:41,319
Who are you?

32
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,080
Want to die?

33
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:43,120
Keep going.

34
00:02:45,088 --> 00:02:46,176
Who is this? Shameless!

35
00:02:48,704 --> 00:02:51,744
(Chen Qingxuan, guard)

36
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:00,599
Young Master.

37
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:02,159
Not Prince Qi's man.

38
00:03:02,432 --> 00:03:05,199
(Wei Xun,
honored guest of Merchant Coalition)

39
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:06,240
If not,

40
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,240
who else would dare cause trouble here?

41
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,520
A martial artist, I guess.

42
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,000
He is

43
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,159
unbelievably strong.

44
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,439
The lock next door

45
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,039
was broken by him with a strike.

46
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:17,800
Look into his background,

47
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,240
but

48
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,639
don't alert him.

49
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,080
Yes.

50
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:24,639
Young Master,

51
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,120
Prince Qi is currently in the capital,

52
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:28,960
but Daizhou is his stronghold,

53
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:31,520
and the Yue family
has been entrenched here for years.

54
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,360
It's quite risky

55
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,639
to come here.

56
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:35,960
I'm afraid...

57
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,759
But I eventually found out

58
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,120
that for Zhu Heng's marriage,

59
00:03:40,199 --> 00:03:41,439
they forged an imperial edict,

60
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,159
trying to kill Yue Wangshu

61
00:03:43,919 --> 00:03:46,199
under the guise
of picking the Loong Consort.

62
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:47,759
They act

63
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,319
with no bottom line.

64
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,439
Instead of being passive,

65
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,199
I'm going all in.

66
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,520
My purpose in Daizhou

67
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:57,840
is to use the Merchant Coalition's spies

68
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,560
to uncover the Yues' weak spots

69
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,879
and then eliminate them.

70
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:02,759
They said they made progress,

71
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,400
which is why we agreed to meet here.

72
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:05,472
But

73
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,800
they're already late.

74
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:09,759
Young Master,

75
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,560
could something have gone wrong?

76
00:04:16,279 --> 00:04:17,040
Young Master,

77
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,319
this room is private.

78
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,600
I visited Merchant Coalition

79
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,079
and found it had been attacked.

80
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:24,079
Everyone inside was slaughtered.

81
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:26,040
On the manager's last wish,

82
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,879
I came to find Master Wei Xun

83
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,399
to warn him to flee at once.

84
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:30,959
Young Master,

85
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:32,680
there was commotion outside.

86
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:33,639
Rushing out

87
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:35,240
may be dangerous.

88
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,720
Let the gentleman in.

89
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,800
That's not our signal.

90
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,680
Why release a signal now?

91
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,120
How can the archers see anything?

92
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,759
We can't miss this chance.

93
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,848
Move!

94
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:58,360
Keep going.

95
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,319
Assassins!

96
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:03,920
What's wrong?

97
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,120
Why are they fighting?

98
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:11,720
Look, what's happening?

99
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:39,079
My apologies.

100
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,920
I dragged you into danger with me.

101
00:05:41,079 --> 00:05:42,272
Relax. We won't die.

102
00:05:59,439 --> 00:06:00,680
Thank you for saving us, sir.

103
00:06:00,839 --> 00:06:02,120
May I have your name?

104
00:06:03,879 --> 00:06:04,959
How did you arrive so fast?

105
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,720
I was here.

106
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,639
What?

107
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:29,120
In Chunfeng Pavilion?

108
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,000
Why did you come here?

109
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:31,879
To study.

110
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:43,360
What?

111
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,560
What's going on again?

112
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:45,240
Sir,

113
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:46,480
why are you back?

114
00:06:47,639 --> 00:06:48,680
I'm leaving, alright.

115
00:06:51,392 --> 00:06:52,864
What's wrong with him?

116
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:54,759
Keep going.

117
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:56,240
What?

118
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,519
He truly has no shame at all!

119
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:00,439
Excuse me, make way.

120
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:07,639
Leave!

121
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:08,399
Why?

122
00:07:08,759 --> 00:07:09,399
Come on!

123
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:10,879
So sorry!

124
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:12,000
It's his first time here.

125
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,000
He has no experience.

126
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:13,600
My apologies.

127
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,279
Please, carry on!

128
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:14,800
I'm studying.

129
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,279
I'm studying.

130
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:16,879
Let go.

131
00:07:17,079 --> 00:07:17,920
Make way, please.

132
00:07:18,199 --> 00:07:19,040
I'm not done yet.

133
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:21,160
Have some shame! Let's go.

134
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:23,000
Young Master, don't leave!

135
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:24,360
Lizhi!

136
00:07:24,576 --> 00:07:25,600
Stop looking!

137
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,800
What's wrong?

138
00:07:27,439 --> 00:07:28,079
Go back.

139
00:07:28,839 --> 00:07:29,839
I haven't finished yet.

140
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:31,639
I'm not done yet.

141
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:34,720
Let go.

142
00:07:35,199 --> 00:07:35,759
Move!

143
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:39,439
We must uncover that guy's background.

144
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,040
Such a strong man

145
00:07:41,441 --> 00:07:42,360
must serve my cause.

146
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:43,825
Understood.

147
00:07:45,121 --> 00:07:46,360
And bury the fallen brothers

148
00:07:47,001 --> 00:07:48,160
with all due ceremony.

149
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,121
Don't let their families down.

150
00:07:50,881 --> 00:07:51,473
Yes.

151
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,441
Young Master,

152
00:07:54,001 --> 00:07:55,081
that smoke earlier...

153
00:07:55,641 --> 00:07:56,761
Let's go check it out.

154
00:08:02,681 --> 00:08:03,840
How dare you ruin our plans!

155
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:18,761
Who sent you?

156
00:08:18,761 --> 00:08:19,761
You released the smoke?

157
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:20,840
Are you stupid?

158
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:21,600
Drop the sword!

159
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,561
Without the smoke,

160
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,360
the archer would've shot us already.

161
00:08:25,641 --> 00:08:26,480
Can't you see that?

162
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,561
Miss...

163
00:08:29,121 --> 00:08:29,745
I...

164
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,521
You're hurt!

165
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,000
No.

166
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,840
It's an old ailment.

167
00:08:37,321 --> 00:08:38,640
It makes walking a bit difficult.

168
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,081
Even so, you still...

169
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,600
Once entrusted, I must do my best.

170
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,041
You are

171
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,681
Master Wei Xun?

172
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,281
Yes.

173
00:08:50,801 --> 00:08:52,041
Where is the young master

174
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:53,760
who brought you word?

175
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:54,760
They've left safely.

176
00:08:56,161 --> 00:08:58,760
Miss, I'm afraid
they have another ambush.

177
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,801
Where do you live?

178
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,840
We'll walk you home.

179
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:03,281
Xingyao!

180
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,281
Xingyao!

181
00:09:05,401 --> 00:09:06,720
Didn't I tell you to go home?

182
00:09:08,161 --> 00:09:10,041
I was so worried that I followed you.

183
00:09:10,041 --> 00:09:11,480
Just now,

184
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,240
Master Wei saved me.

185
00:09:13,801 --> 00:09:15,321
We meet again.

186
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:17,960
Thank you, Master Wei.

187
00:09:22,521 --> 00:09:24,049
(The Merchant Coalition values him.)

188
00:09:24,681 --> 00:09:25,640
(What happened today)

189
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:26,681
(is unexpected,)

190
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:29,041
(but it's an exceptional opportunity.)

191
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:32,720
I am Wei Xun.

192
00:09:33,281 --> 00:09:35,561
Thank you for saving me earlier.

193
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,880
I owe you one huge favor.

194
00:09:38,521 --> 00:09:40,281
And I hope to make friends with you.

195
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:41,801
If possible,

196
00:09:42,321 --> 00:09:43,840
I will repay you big time.

197
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,640
You're too kind.

198
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,960
I am Wangyue.

199
00:09:48,161 --> 00:09:49,521
Thank you for saving my sister.

200
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,120
It's getting late.

201
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:53,360
Where are you staying?

202
00:09:54,161 --> 00:09:56,921
My sister and I will prepare gifts

203
00:09:57,161 --> 00:09:58,240
and visit you another day.

204
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:02,401
Lizhi!

205
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:03,760
Put me down!

206
00:10:04,041 --> 00:10:04,760
Put me down!

207
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:05,408
Young Master...

208
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,000
They are...

209
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,240
They have a special bond.

210
00:10:52,441 --> 00:10:53,360
What is this?

211
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:55,960
You've made me drink this every day
since you returned.

212
00:10:56,201 --> 00:10:57,401
I don't know what it is.

213
00:11:08,401 --> 00:11:09,041
Wangshu,

214
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,801
I'm sorry.

215
00:11:11,201 --> 00:11:12,240
You have trouble walking,

216
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,360
yet you took such a risk!

217
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,480
I told you to go home.

218
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,360
I'm not afraid of danger.

219
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:21,880
I just didn't want
to stand by like before,

220
00:11:22,081 --> 00:11:23,801
watching you walk into danger

221
00:11:23,801 --> 00:11:25,000
and doing nothing to help.

222
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,681
I was just worried
and wanted to follow at first.

223
00:11:29,441 --> 00:11:31,081
Then I saw archers across the street.

224
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,401
I thought

225
00:11:32,401 --> 00:11:34,321
the smoke mixed with pungent herbs

226
00:11:35,521 --> 00:11:36,801
would mess up Chunfeng Pavilion

227
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,441
and blind their sight.

228
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:39,960
Acting in haste,

229
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,000
they'd make a mistake,

230
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,281
giving you a chance to escape.

231
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:50,640
Xingyao,

232
00:11:53,441 --> 00:11:54,401
you did great.

233
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:01,401
I always thought
I was your only support,

234
00:12:02,321 --> 00:12:03,041
forgetting

235
00:12:04,441 --> 00:12:05,801
that we are

236
00:12:06,161 --> 00:12:07,760
each other's fortress.

237
00:12:11,281 --> 00:12:12,081
(Perhaps,)

238
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,760
(even without the loong,)

239
00:12:14,161 --> 00:12:16,240
(Xingyao could carve out a path)

240
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:18,321
(in this predatory world.)

241
00:12:19,161 --> 00:12:20,120
(I only hope...)

242
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:22,880
(I hope...)

243
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,041
You're not mad at me anymore?

244
00:12:30,161 --> 00:12:30,960
You guessed right.

245
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:34,760
I'm glad you're safe.

246
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:40,041
We haven't
traced that young master's origins,

247
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:42,921
but the young lady who helped us today

248
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:45,640
is the late General Yue's daughter.

249
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:46,640
The Yue family?

250
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:50,000
Then the one they sacrificed
with a forged edict...

251
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,600
Yes,

252
00:12:50,801 --> 00:12:51,960
that was her older sister.

253
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,880
After General Yue died,

254
00:12:54,081 --> 00:12:56,921
the Jiang family mistreated the sisters
in the general's manor.

255
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,840
She was beaten for fighting back

256
00:12:58,840 --> 00:12:59,880
and crippled.

257
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:03,161
Had her sister not carried her out
overnight

258
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:05,041
and rushed miles for a physician,

259
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,960
she would've died long ago.

260
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,041
She now stays at her mother's old house.

261
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,640
Prepare some medicine
to treat leg ailments.

262
00:13:14,041 --> 00:13:15,960
I will go visit her another day.

263
00:13:16,161 --> 00:13:16,800
Yes.

264
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:19,801
As for the martial expert,

265
00:13:20,041 --> 00:13:21,240
forgive my incompetence,

266
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,240
but I found nothing of his past.

267
00:13:23,401 --> 00:13:25,360
It's as though he appeared
out of thin air.

268
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,441
However,

269
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,681
I've found

270
00:13:28,681 --> 00:13:30,000
that he frequents the marketplace

271
00:13:30,281 --> 00:13:32,201
and acts rather strangely.

272
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:35,480
He seems deeply intrigued
by certain picture books.

273
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:37,321
A brave man enjoying stories?

274
00:13:37,681 --> 00:13:38,600
What's the big deal?

275
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:41,441
He only reads erotic picture books.

276
00:13:44,041 --> 00:13:47,081
Today, a vendor selling those books
led him to Chunfeng Pavilion.

277
00:13:47,681 --> 00:13:49,640
He kicked open a private room door

278
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,600
and asked the panicked couple inside

279
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,880
to continue.

280
00:13:56,801 --> 00:13:57,760
He didn't tip anyone,

281
00:13:58,041 --> 00:13:59,681
nor did he lay a finger on any woman.

282
00:13:59,921 --> 00:14:02,281
But toward the young gentleman
with him...

283
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,201
If I may be so bold,

284
00:14:04,441 --> 00:14:07,081
I guess he has...

285
00:14:10,441 --> 00:14:12,041
He has a peculiar taste.

286
00:14:14,081 --> 00:14:16,041
Peculiar taste?

287
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:34,000
(Merchant Coalition got hit hard,)

288
00:14:34,561 --> 00:14:35,521
(but I'm sure)

289
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,880
(Prince Qi struck
because he fears the Emperor.)

290
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:39,441
(Their struggle)

291
00:14:39,441 --> 00:14:41,120
(must have reached a boiling point.)

292
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,240
(I need to think)

293
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:45,441
(about how to take advantage of this.)

294
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,480
Today, in front of Master Wei Xun,

295
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,441
why did you suddenly...?

296
00:14:51,441 --> 00:14:52,640
You looked flighty back then.

297
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,441
Stop misusing words!

298
00:14:54,561 --> 00:14:55,401
Then what is

299
00:14:55,401 --> 00:14:56,360
the right word?

300
00:14:57,561 --> 00:14:59,281
Master Wei is
from the Merchant Coalition.

301
00:14:59,561 --> 00:15:00,561
Befriending him

302
00:15:00,561 --> 00:15:02,081
helps me investigate the Yue family

303
00:15:02,281 --> 00:15:03,681
for my plans.

304
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:05,201
It's called strategic planning,

305
00:15:05,441 --> 00:15:06,401
you silly loong.

306
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:08,161
If you need anything, just tell me.

307
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,681
Why rely on others?

308
00:15:10,081 --> 00:15:11,480
How many times must I tell you?

309
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:12,801
You're not invincible.

310
00:15:13,201 --> 00:15:14,240
If you stand out too much

311
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:15,801
and someone malicious notices,

312
00:15:16,041 --> 00:15:17,161
they will capture me

313
00:15:17,441 --> 00:15:18,281
or even kill me,

314
00:15:18,681 --> 00:15:20,240
making you lose control of the Li Fire.

315
00:15:20,401 --> 00:15:21,561
What will you do then?

316
00:15:21,728 --> 00:15:22,321
I...

317
00:15:22,321 --> 00:15:23,441
How will you ever get home?

318
00:15:23,801 --> 00:15:25,281
I don't want to cause you trouble.

319
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:35,401
Just remember one thing:

320
00:15:36,561 --> 00:15:37,801
as long as you obey me,

321
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:39,760
you'll get a reward.

322
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,321
I'll look at others

323
00:15:41,321 --> 00:15:42,561
and talk to others,

324
00:15:42,760 --> 00:15:43,681
but my reward

325
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,360
is only for you.

326
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:55,441
Does it hurt?

327
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:03,201
You actually moved this injury
onto yourself.

328
00:16:05,281 --> 00:16:06,801
I'll be more careful next time.

329
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:09,240
If I need to summon you in an emergency,

330
00:16:09,561 --> 00:16:10,521
I won't hurt myself.

331
00:16:11,081 --> 00:16:12,960
Instead,
I'll just press hard on my palm.

332
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:13,840
Can you feel that?

333
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:17,360
No. I inevitably bump into things,

334
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:18,840
and if you rush over then,

335
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:19,480
it'll be a mess.

336
00:16:21,401 --> 00:16:22,201
I got an idea.

337
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,360
I'll teach you to write.

338
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:25,081
No matter how far apart we are,

339
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,960
if I write on my palm,

340
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,000
you'll know what I'm thinking.

341
00:16:31,201 --> 00:16:31,960
Come.

342
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,801
Let me bandage you.

343
00:16:37,696 --> 00:16:39,072
(Li)

344
00:16:40,321 --> 00:16:42,401
Lizhi.

345
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,640
Eyes off me. Focus on the character.

346
00:16:47,104 --> 00:16:48,480
(Lizhi)

347
00:16:49,801 --> 00:16:52,161
A name
carries your family's hopes for you.

348
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:53,521
You must remember.

349
00:16:56,441 --> 00:16:57,521
My name

350
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,960
means "dying away".

351
00:17:00,401 --> 00:17:01,960
It also means "never to be parted".

352
00:17:04,561 --> 00:17:05,561
How to write your name?

353
00:17:06,048 --> 00:17:10,336
♪I seek in the moonlight
for the rest of my life♪

354
00:17:10,721 --> 00:17:11,521
Yue

355
00:17:13,241 --> 00:17:14,961
Wangshu.

356
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,001
Wangshu

357
00:17:17,801 --> 00:17:19,481
is the god
who drives the moon's chariot,

358
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:21,680
and later came to mean the moon.

359
00:17:22,561 --> 00:17:23,481
Yue Wangshu:

360
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:27,481
standing atop high mountains,
watching the bright moon.

361
00:17:30,336 --> 00:17:33,344
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

362
00:17:33,344 --> 00:17:35,648
♪Take root after drowning♪

363
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:40,880
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

364
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,920
Next,

365
00:17:42,801 --> 00:17:43,880
what do you want to learn?

366
00:17:47,392 --> 00:17:52,982
♪A rouge-tinted letter
brings a distant lover close♪

367
00:17:52,982 --> 00:17:58,646
♪Torn apart by time,
regrets still intertwine♪

368
00:17:58,646 --> 00:18:04,279
♪We hope to meet, but won't confess♪

369
00:18:04,279 --> 00:18:09,900
♪You're the one I wish to hold
through every page and scene♪

370
00:18:10,114 --> 00:18:19,284
♪A single tear
burns love and hate to ashes♪

371
00:18:39,424 --> 00:18:41,728
♪If love were a noun♪

372
00:18:41,728 --> 00:18:44,448
♪Woven with pain♪
